1
00:00:03,169 --> 00:00:05,759
SHELDON: You know, I've been thinking
about time travel again.

2
00:00:05,922 --> 00:00:08,762
Why? Did you hit a roadblock
with invisibility?

3
00:00:10,093 --> 00:00:11,473
(Sheldon:)Put it on the back burner.

4
00:00:12,429 --> 00:00:15,639
(Sheldon:)Anyway, it occurs to me,
if I ever did perfect a time machine...

5
00:00:15,807 --> 00:00:17,937
...I'd go into the past
and give it to myself.

6
00:00:18,101 --> 00:00:21,641
(Sheldon:)Thus eliminating the need for me
to invent it in the first place.

7
00:00:22,522 --> 00:00:25,812
(Sheldon:)- Interesting.
- Yeah, it really takes the pressure off.

8
00:00:26,568 --> 00:00:27,818
(Leonard:)Sounds like a breakthrough.

9
00:00:27,986 --> 00:00:30,486
Should I call Science
and tell them to hold the cover?

10
00:00:30,655 --> 00:00:32,995
(Sheldon:)It's time travel, Leonard.
I will have done that.

11
00:00:35,035 --> 00:00:36,915
(Leonard:)I guess congratulations are in order.

12
00:00:37,078 --> 00:00:41,038
(Sheldon:)No, congratulations
will have been in order.

13
00:00:41,207 --> 00:00:43,207
(Sheldon:)You know,
I'm not going to enjoy this party.

14
00:00:43,376 --> 00:00:45,336
LEONARD:
I know, I'm familiar with you.

15
00:00:45,795 --> 00:00:48,335
SHELDON: The last party,
Professor Finkleday cornered me...

16
00:00:48,506 --> 00:00:50,846
(Sheldon:)...and talked about spelunking
for 45 minutes.

17
00:00:51,009 --> 00:00:52,049
(Leonard:)Yes, I was there.

18
00:00:52,218 --> 00:00:54,058
(Sheldon:)You know what's interesting
about caves?

19
00:00:54,220 --> 00:00:56,560
- What?
- Nothing.

20
00:00:57,432 --> 00:01:01,812
We'll avoid Finkleday, meet the new head,
congratulate him, shake his hand and go.

